update of Wraphelp, xdm now works again on FreeBSD/alpha.

You can run xdm without starting an X server and X -query connect
to it.  (Having xdm start up an X server directly will probably
work too, but I haven't tried.)

X -indirect still only gets a single, useless entry "list" rather
than an actual list of hosts to connect to, at least for broadcast
mode.

